# The repository root ignores `lib/` to skip build output, and that pattern
# matches ANY directory called lib at any depth — including this app's
# foundation layer. Un-ignoring the directory itself is what makes its contents
# visible again; a negation on the files alone would not work, because git
# cannot re-include a file whose parent directory is excluded.
!src/lib/

